default.webp", "preference": -6, "id": "35"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/-m9xpFEwRBc/sddefault.jpg", "height": 480, "width": 640, "preference": -5, "id": "36", "resolution": "640x480"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/-m9xpFEwRBc/sddefault.webp", "preference": -4, "id": "37"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/-m9xpFEwRBc/hq720.jpg", "preference": -3, "id": "38"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/-m9xpFEwRBc/hq720.webp", "preference": -2, "id": "39"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/-m9xpFEwRBc/maxresdefault.jpg", "height": 1080, "width": 1920, "preference": -1, "id": "40", "resolution": "1920x1080"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/-m9xpFEwRBc/maxresdefault.webp", "preference": 0, "id": "41"}], "thumbnail": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/-m9xpFEwRBc/maxresdefault.jpg", "description": "Nafakhum is one of the most beautiful waterfalls in Bangladesh and an excellent place to travel. Every traveler should have a tour plan to visit this beautiful tourism spot of Bandarban at least once and then they will feel to visit that travel spot again and again.\n\nNafakhum is situated on the wild hilly Sangu River at a remote area called Remakri of Thanchi upazilla under Bandarban Hill District in Bangladesh. Nafakhum is also known as Remakri waterfall. It is among the largest waterfalls in Bangladesh by volume of water falling.\n\nNafa is a one kind of local fish, Khum means falls. Nafa fishes are available in this waterfalls area, for this reasons local name this area is Nafakhum. This natural falls is situated at Thanchi upazila in Bandarban district.\n\nHow to go: Firstly you have to go Badarban, from Bandarban town you will go to Thanchi by local jeep or public bus. Fare for bus 190 tk per person, reserved jeep may cost around 5 thousand tk. It takes to time around 4-5 hours. From Thanchi you have to take a guide, it is mandatory. Guide charge 500 tk per day and guide society charge 100 tk. Guide will help to you how will reach at Nafakhum. In here you have to take permission from BGB camp and have to write all information about you and your guide.\nOur next destination will Remakri. From Thanchi you have to hire a boat. Rowing boat is more appropriate for this river. You have to take some fruit, dry food and water because this journey is too long. After 3-4 hours you will reach at Tindu. It is a wonderful place, large size stones are lay down in the river, as like a kingdom of rock.\nFrom Thanchi it takes around 8 hours to reach Remakri. From Remakri have to need 2-3 hours to reach Nafakhum by walk. Boat doesn't run in this river. The natural beauty of Nafakhum is mind blowing, as like a charming hilly girl is going through curved way. You will find some rest house at Remakri or you can stay at tribal house..\nFB-mohammad.rasel341", "channel_id": "UCyyzg-8H7KQUIk2n1iyeHCw", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCyyzg-8H7KQUIk2n1iyeHCw", "duration": 16, "view_count": 381, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-m9xpFEwRBc", "categories": ["People & Blogs"], "tags": [], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_type": "video", "_format_sort_fields": ["quality", "res", "fps", "hdr:12", "source", "vcodec", "channels", "acodec", "lang", "proto"], "automatic_captions": {}, "subtitles": {}, "like_count": 2, "channel": "Rasel Mahmud ", "channel_follower_count": 70, "uploader": "Rasel Mahmud ", "uploader_id": "@rasel2108", "uploader_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@rasel2108", "upload_date": "20160927", "timestamp": 1474952410, "availability": "public", "webpage_url_basename": "watch", "webpage_url_domain": "youtube.com", "extractor": "youtube", "extractor_key": "Youtube", "display_id": "-m9xpFEwRBc", "fulltitle": "Nafakhum Waterfall -নাফাখুম জলপ্রপাত", "duration_string": "16", "is_live": false, "was_live": false, "epoch": 1781109029, "asr": 44100, "format_id": "18", "format_note": "360p", "source_preference": -1, "fps": 30, "audio_channels": 2, "height": 360, "quality": 6.0, "has